ICA Toolkit Android Plugin :
Fingerprint Plugin for Android Device

This is a fingerprint plugin for Android Device (AirSnap - Finger Capture through Android Mobile Camera)

Supported Android Application Binary Interfaces (ABIs) for Android Mobile:
	1.armeabi-v7a
	2.arm64-v8a

Permissions:
Camera 
<uses-permission android:name="android.permission.CAMERA" /><uses-feature    android:name="android.hardware.camera"    android:required="false" />

Dependencies:
